# Merge gating for the shared Claude config.
#
# Enable "Require review from Code Owners" in branch protection on `main` for
# these rules to take effect. A PR needs approval from *one* listed owner —
# eng OR the relevant team lead.

# Org-wide surface (always-on rules + core skills + install/sync machinery):
# engineering must approve, since it ships to everyone.
/rules/        @Traba-Ops/platform
/skills/       @Traba-Ops/platform
/docs/         @Traba-Ops/platform
/install.sh    @Traba-Ops/platform
/sync.sh       @Traba-Ops/platform
/CODEOWNERS    @Traba-Ops/platform

# Team skill folders: engineering OR that team's leads can approve.
# NOTE: the *-leads teams below do not exist in the org yet. Create them
# (or replace each with individual @usernames) before turning on branch
# protection, otherwise those lines won't enforce.
/teams/customer-ops/   @Traba-Ops/platform @Traba-Ops/customer-ops-leads
/teams/worker-ops/     @Traba-Ops/platform @Traba-Ops/worker-ops-leads
/teams/scaled-ops/     @Traba-Ops/platform @Traba-Ops/scaled-ops-leads
